Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: libfprint
Source: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/libfprint/-/tree/feature/sdcp-v2
Comment: Repackages upstream freedesktop.org libfprint, branch feature/sdcp-v2
 (merge request 547, which adds the Microsoft SDCP match-on-chip protocol),
 at commit 2d7c5277, with a three-patch series carried under debian/patches/:
 EgisTec ET171 (1c7a:05aa) device support, an SDCP core fix, and two egismoc
 robustness fixes. All three patches are our own work (see their From: headers);
 the ET171 support was informed by EvernightFedora's earlier ET171 work against
 the TenSeventy7 libfprint fork, re-authored here for the upstream sdcp-v2 base.
 The authoritative per-file copyright and authorship remain in the upstream
 source headers within the .orig tarball.

